#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:16 1f0d98eb484b49c487410a9692937e73
msgid "Pitch shifter for changing the pitch of audio without affecting playback speed."
msgstr "音高变换效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:21 31a07482fe064012ae0748e2c4a60108
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:23 f7ce84140bf5478b9a63a615792063fb
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPitchShift changes the pitch (perceived frequency) of the audio signal without "
"changing its duration or playback speed. This is useful for creating harmonization effects, "
"correcting pitch, or creating special sound effects."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectPitchShift**    用 FFT 处理改变信号音高。   ``pitch_scale``    控制音高倍率，   ``fft_size``    与"
"    ``oversampling``    会影响声音质量、延迟和 CPU 开销。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:25 9de8611f6d794d35ade4d2883b86dfce
msgid ""
"The effect uses FFT (Fast Fourier Transform) based processing with adjustable FFT size and "
"oversampling parameters to control the quality and latency trade-offs. Larger FFT sizes provide "
"better frequency resolution but introduce more latency, while oversampling can improve quality at"
" the cost of increased CPU usage."
msgstr "基于 FFT（快速傅里叶变换）处理，可通过 FFT 大小和过采样参数调节质量与延迟。FFT 越大，频率分辨率越高，延迟也越大；过采样可改善质量，同时增加 CPU 开销。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:27 2477f699138649869012205e007d9c70
msgid ""
"Pitch can be adjusted via pitch scale (multiplier) for intuitive control. A pitch scale of 1.0 is"
" unity, 2.0 is one octave up, and 0.5 is one octave down."
msgstr "通过音高倍率控制音高：1.0 为原音高，2.0 升高一个八度，0.5 降低一个八度。"

