#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:169 57c048d02506402a93b5679ceeab5ec4
msgid ""
"The size of the FFT window used for pitch shifting. Larger sizes provide better frequency "
"resolution but increase latency. Options: "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_256<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_256>`, "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_512<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_512>`, "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_1024<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_1024>`, "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_2048<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_2048>`, "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_4096<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_4096>`. Default: "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_2048<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_2048>`. Use smaller sizes "
"for lower latency and larger sizes for better quality."
msgstr ""
"FFT 窗口大小 （参见   :ref:`FFT_SIZE_256<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_256>`  ） （参见"
"   :ref:`FFT_SIZE_512<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_512>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_1024<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_1024>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_2048<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_2048>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_4096<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_4096>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`FFT_SIZE_2048<class_FmodAudioEffectPitchShift_constant_FFT_SIZE_2048>`  ）"

