#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:148 2eb0a925fe0e4cf89fa29f48c8765930
msgid ""
"The pitch multiplier, clamped to 0.01 through 16.0. It must be greater than 0.0; invalid "
"nonpositive values are rejected. The default is 1.0. A value of 2.0 shifts up one octave and "
"0.5 shifts down one octave. Convert semitones with ``pow(2.0, semitones / 12.0)``."
msgstr ""
"音高倍率，限制在 0.01 到 16.0，必须大于 0.0，非正值会被拒绝。默认为 1.0。2.0 升高一个八度，0.5 降低一个八度。半音数可使用  ``pow(2.0, "
"semitones / 12.0)``  转换。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpitchshift.rst:182 1a40cfbcf68445fda7810241dd190a48
msgid ""
"The overlap factor passed to FMOD's pitch-shift DSP, clamped to 4 through 32. The default is "
"4. This property controls FFT overlap, rather than increasing the output sample rate."
msgstr "传给 FMOD 音高变换 DSP 的重叠因子，限制在 4 到 32，默认为 4。该属性控制 FFT 重叠，不会提高输出采样率。"
